Description:It is your first main phase. You control Dralnu's Crusade, Garruk's Gorehorn and five Swamps, and have Conspiracy in hand. The opponent is at 8 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-3b6b4222b9855e6c | Dralnu's Crusade depends on Conspiracy, since Conspiracy changes what the Crusade applies to (CR 613.8a), so Conspiracy applies first whatever the timestamps (CR 613.8b): naming Goblin makes the Gorehorn a Goblin the Crusade pumps, an 8/4 attacker
